<section class="section-alt" id="how-to-use">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="reveal" style="max-width:680px">
      <p class="eyebrow">How to Use</p>
      <h2 class="h-lg">Make Natgenic Part of Your Routine</h2>
      <div class="divider" style="margin-top:28px"></div>
      <p class="lead">Three simple steps. Repeated consistently.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal">
        <p class="step-num">01: APPLY</p>
        <h3>Apply</h3>
        <p>Apply the recommended amount of Natgenic to the scalp and hair.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <p class="step-num">02: MASSAGE</p>
        <h3>Massage</h3>
        <p>Gently massage into the scalp to distribute the oil evenly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <p class="step-num">03: STAY CONSISTENT</p>
        <h3>Stay Consistent</h3>
        <p>Follow the recommended routine consistently and give your hair time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="note reveal">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" height="17" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" /><path d="M12 8h.01" /><path d="M12 12v4" />
      </svg>
      Consistency matters more than overnight results.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
